INT. STRANDED CABLE CAR - ALPINE RIDGE - DAWN

A glass-walled gondola hanging motionless over a gorge. Frost on the windows. A white sea of cloud below. The cable creaks. A single bench seat, a steel pole.

Three passengers. They have been here since last night.

HANNELORE BRÜCKNER, 60s, in a loden coat, sits upright with her handbag on her knees. Her lips are blue. She has not complained once.

ISAAC MBEKI-LOWE, 30s, in a ski jacket, crouches against the door. His phone is dead. He taps it anyway.

PAULINE ACHTERBERG, 20s, in a thin windbreaker, huddles in the corner with a thermos. She unscrews it, checks it, screws it shut.

The gondola sways. Everyone stops breathing until it stills.

ISAAC
Anyone have a lighter?

HANNELORE
I don't smoke.

ISAAC
It's not for smoking.

PAULINE
I have matches.

ISAAC
Why didn't you say?

PAULINE
You didn't ask.

She hands him a small box. He takes it, strikes one. It flares and dies. He strikes another and cups it. They all lean toward the tiny glow like a campfire.

Hannelore opens her handbag. Takes out a folded newspaper. Smooths it on her knee. Holds it out.

HANNELORE
It burns.

ISAAC
It's your paper.

HANNELORE
It's yesterday's.

Isaac takes it. Tears off a corner. Lights it. A thin yellow flame climbs and wavers, and the gondola glows for a few seconds. Nobody speaks.

Pauline reaches out and lets her palm hover over the flame. Isaac moves the paper closer to her without a word. When it burns down to his fingers, he lets it fall and stamps it out.

The cable jolts. Everyone grabs a rail. A distant mechanical groan comes from the tower. Hannelore turns her head slowly toward the sound, as though recognizing an old acquaintance.

HANNELORE (CONT'D)
That is the generator.

ISAAC
How do you know?

HANNELORE
My husband built the first one.

PAULINE
Is that good?

HANNELORE
It means they are trying.

The gondola lurches forward a foot and stops. Pauline laughs once, a dry bark. Isaac slides down the door and sits. Hannelore folds her hands again, and for the first time her shoulders drop.
